00:11:17.276 --> 00:11:19.779
That's awesome, man.
You can feel --

00:11:19.779 --> 00:11:21.747
You can feel the vibe,
I think, there, I think,

00:11:21.747 --> 00:11:23.949
in the city walking around
in New York City.

00:11:23.949 --> 00:11:27.486
I think, you know, people are
out with masks and doing it,

00:11:27.486 --> 00:11:29.188
